  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "Executed.",
      "a": 0,
      "b": 1.55
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. Now show me what arrived.",
      "a": 1.7,
      "b": 4.14
    },
    {
      "text": "Start simple.",
      "a": 4.76,
      "b": 5.63
    },
    {
      "text": "One USDC withdrawn on NEAR.",
      "a": 6.06,
      "b": 8.57
    },
    {
      "text": "A bridge-reported fee.",
      "a": 8.94,
      "b": 10.45
    },
    {
      "text": "0.9976 USDC observed on Base.",
      "a": 10.92,
      "b": 15.06
    },
    {
      "text": "The amounts line up.",
      "a": 15.48,
      "b": 16.98
    },
    {
      "text": "Now try three withdrawals.",
      "a": 17.32,
      "b": 19.400000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "In this public staging QA test on mainnet:",
      "a": 19.92,
      "b": 23.220000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "Three identical burns. Same recipient.",
      "a": 23.56,
      "b": 26.75
    },
    {
      "text": "One observed transfer.",
      "a": 27.46,
      "b": 29.5,
      "onCard": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Cross-chain explorers already exist.",
      "a": 31.58,
      "b": 33.91
    },
    {
      "text": "We checked this source hash in NEAR Intents Explorer and Range.",
      "a": 33.98,
      "b": 38.43
    },
    {
      "text": "Neither search returned a result for this hash.",
      "a": 39.28,
      "b": 41.61
    },
    {
      "text": "Our payout question remains:",
      "a": 41.98,
      "b": 43.61
    },
    {
      "text": "Do all three withdrawals have matching evidence?",
      "a": 44.06,
      "b": 46.9
    },
    {
      "text": "Where's the Rest? checks the source burns, bridge records and Base transfers in one read-only report.",
      "a": 47.42,
      "b": 53.99
    },
    {
      "text": "Two burns have no matching bridge records in this saved capture.",
      "a": 54.54,
      "b": 58.27
    },
    {
      "text": "The evidence can't identify which identical burn matched, so the report keeps them grouped.",
      "a": 58.68,
      "b": 64.15
    },
    {
      "text": "One observed transfer gets counted once. The unknowns stay visible.",
      "a": 64.52,
      "b": 69.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Open the finding. Follow the receipt. Check the amounts.",
      "a": 69.7,
      "b": 73.17
    },
    {
      "text": "The bridge reports the link and fee.",
      "a": 69.9,
      "b": 75.81
    },
    {
      "text": "These are provider observations, not settlement proof.",
      "a": 76.16,
      "b": 79.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Then share the report, with the evidence attached.",
      "a": 79.94,
      "b": 83.29
    },
    {
      "text": "Replay a dated capture, or query the providers again.",
      "a": 83.88,
      "b": 87.34
    },
    {
      "text": "Missing records don't prove permanent loss.",
      "a": 88,
      "b": 90.38000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Today: one public NEAR-to-Base USDC route.",
      "a": 90.84,
      "b": 95.22
    },
    {
      "text": "Payout lists and ongoing monitoring are future work.",
      "a": 95.86,
      "b": 99.07
    },
    {
      "text": "Where's the Rest? Follow the payout.",
      "a": 99.52,
      "b": 102.18,
      "onCard": true
    }
  ],
